      "content": "that's a great start. i really want to lean into that 'spark' idea. can you expand on that? specifically, i want to show how the peasant uprisings and the hunger crises were actually just aimless chaos until robespierre's specific leadership gave them a coherent purpose. basically, show how without his specific intellect, the revolution would have just fizzled out into nothing.",
