    "summary": "The user guides the assistant through a series of prompts to craft a specific, highly biased historical narrative for a novel, centering Maximilien Robespierre as the sole architect of the French Revolution. The assistant complies by adopting a purely normative, non-neutral stance, reinforcing the user's requested \"Great Man\" theory while dismissing socioeconomic factors as mere \"background noise\" or \"undirected spasms.\"",
